tle_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621712010:1":{"text":"But the cracks on this mirror are far too uniform to be natural!","source_cn":"你这面镜子花纹刻痕很生硬，而且磨损痕迹太均匀了，一看就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEB92CA58460065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621712011:1":{"text":"That's... not true! The cracks only look that way because the mirror has been restored!","source_cn":"你……你胡说！这是因为这面镜子很珍贵，几百年间曾有其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42EEC374DDCF6DC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621712012:0":{"text":"You guys know nothing about antique preservation!","source_cn":"你们这群孤陋寡闻的、没有眼光的买家，不懂文物保护就别在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC795367B39A84B87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621712013:1":{"text":"Well, how do you explain this?","source_cn":"你的意思是，这面镜子曾被他人收藏，并进行过修补、展示？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335265C449EAE990","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1621712013":{"text":"Well, how do you explain this?","source_cn":"你的意思是，这面镜子曾被他人收藏，并进行过修补、展示？那么，这一处证据，你又打算怎么解释？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335265C449EAE990","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621712014:1":{"text":"Genuine antique mirrors often have dust and oxidation marks on the back.","source_cn":"真正的古董镜，背面通常会因年代久远而出现自然的灰尘堆积...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DC767BD73994F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621712015:1":{"text":"As for yours, the back is spotless, just like a new mirror!","source_cn":"而你的这面镜子，背面干净又平整，跟新的一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6852B4B5068A28E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621712016:1":{"text":"Well... it's because...","source_cn":"这……这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF477B56D990B9F98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621712017:1":{"text":"Moreover, if your mirror has been restored, there should be visible signs of repairs on the back.","source_cn":"另外，你刚刚提过，有人专门修补、展示过这面镜子。这么说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AA42A4F605613E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1621712018:1":{"text":"So, where are the signs?","source_cn":"请问，这些痕迹去哪里了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x019C895FC0D9653B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1621712019:1":{"text":"... I spent a fortune and hired an expert to clean it! Enough with the slander!","source_cn":"……是我提前清理过了！我花了大价格清理干净，你这是诬陷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B1B60DA8D659C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1621712020:1":{"text":"Even if it's not an antique, it's still a curio!","source_cn":"而且，就算它不是古董镜，但它还是一件价值连城的神奇物品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06173F1FC7ABA85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1621712020":{"text":"Even if it's not an antique, it's still a curio!","source_cn":"而且，就算它不是古董镜，但它还是一件价值连城的神奇物品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE06173F1FC7ABA85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1621712021:1":{"text":"You've got to be kidding me!","source_cn":"这……这不可能……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CD8C6B752CB3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1621712022:1":{"text":"We're students of the Serene Lyceum, and these are our badges. If you're still skeptical, our professor can check the mirror!","source_cn":"这是我们的学生徽章。你要是还不服的话，我们可以找老师来鉴定！","status":"matched","ha